2 CONT changed religion from Amen to sun god Aten (Aton) and moved capital from Thebes to Akhetaten (Horizon of Aten) a new city in middle Egypt "Atonville" At his death the priests of Amen forced a return to Thebes, and children- courti
2 CONC ers changed names from ***Aton to  ***Amen  example Tut Aken Aton became Tut Aken Amen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Later  Pharaohs wanted to eliminate this "heresy" period so the reign
2 CONT of Horemheb was set to start with the year 1 of Amenhotep IV and he was assigned 59 years when in truth he reigned only 25 years.
