2 CONT Artaxerxes I of PersiaFrom Wikipedia, the free encyclopediaJump to: navigation, search Artaxerxes I of Persia 
2 CONT
2 CONT "Artaxerxes Longimanus, King of Persia" as portrayed by Guillaume Rouille  Reign 465 to 424 BC  Born ??  Died 424 BC  Buried Naqsh-e Rustam, Persia  Predecessor Xerxes I  Successor Xerxes II  Consort Queen Damaspia Alogyne of Baby
