2 CONT
2 CONT Mithridates
2 CONT
2 CONT Phriapatius(?), probable ancestor of Arsacids
2 CONT
2 CONT Amestris, wife of Artaxerxes II
2 CONT
2 CONT Rhodogune, wife of satrap Orontes
2 CONT
2 CONT Apama, wife of Pharnabazus
2 CONT
2 CONT Ocha, mother of an unnamed wife of Artaxerxes III
2 CONT
