2 CONT 29. Sahakanoysh, the Gregoridian heiress, = Hamazasp I, Prince of theMamikonids, High-Constable of Armenia 387-432 [note: the Mamikonidsdescended from a mid-third century Chinese prince (250), and, throughhim, from ancient Chinese
