2 CONT =Mithrenes II=
2 CONT '''
2 CONT
2 CONT Mithrenes (Armenian: Միհրան) is also mentioned as Mithras, High Priest of the temple to the Sun at Armavir. Whether he ever ruled as a king is not known, although later kings such as Tigran were both high priest and king.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source : '''
