1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Source 1: http://www.ruqaiyyah.karoo.net/articles/prophfamily2.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Source 2: http://www.maaref-foundation.com/english/library/pro_ahl/imam01_ali/biography_of_imam_ali/002.htm
2 CONT
