2 CONT Speller, Elizabeth (2003). Following Hadrian: a second-century journey through the Roman Empire. London: Review. ISBN 0-7472-6662-X.
2 CONT *Yourcenar, Marguerite. Memoirs of Hadrian. New York: Farrar, Straus and Giroux. ISBN 0-374-52926-4.
2 CONT *http://www.mavors.org/PDFs/Commagene.pdf
2 CONT *http://www.questia.com/PM.qst?a=o&d=29061784
