2 CONT
2 CONT He was a son of [http://www.geni.com/people/Decimus-Rusticus/6000000004089149574 Decimus Rusticus] and and his wife [http://www.geni.com/people/Artemia/6000000010299987649 Artemia].
2 CONT
2 CONT He married [http://www.geni.com/people/Tullia/6000000005747722679 Tullia]. They were parents of:
