2 CONT
2 CONT 1.1. Saint Shushanik (+472) 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Hmayeak I (+452) 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1. Vahan 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1.1. Vard 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.2. Vasak 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.2.1. Enmanuel 
2 CONT
