2 CONT
2 CONT From ''Banu Taym'' Tribe (Part of ''Banu Quraysh'' Tribe).
2 CONT
2 CONT Source 1: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abu_Bakr_As-Siddiq
2 CONT
2 CONT Source 2: http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abu_Bakr
2 CONT
