1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''3rd Rashidun Caliph'''
2 CONT
2 CONT [Caucasian Albania was first conquered by the Muslim Arabs during the reign of the third caliph, Uthman ibn Affan...]
2 CONT
2 CONT He is buried at Jannat al-Baqi (http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jannat_al-Baqi).
2 CONT
2 CONT [CITATIONS]
2 CONT
2 CONT [S653] PoH, online http://www.friesian.com/
2 CONT
