1 CONC  12, 13, 14 and Year 15 appears somewhat unlikely. More importantly, Peter Brand in a JARCE 34(1997) pp.101-114 paper titled "The 'Lost' Obelisks and Colossi of Seti I," noted that the king personally opened new rock quarries at A
