1 CONT Moyra Caldecott: novel The Ghost of Akhenaten (eBook, 2001, ISBN 1899142894; 2003, ISBN 1843190249) 
1 CONT Lynda Robinson, historical mystery, Drinker of Blood (2001, ISBN 0446677515) 
