1 CONT     * 5 Tutankhamun in popular culture
1 CONT           o 5.1 Discovery of Tutankhamun's tomb
1 CONT           o 5.2 Tutankhamun's appearance and controversy
1 CONT                 + 5.2.1 Skin tone
