0 @N6000000002187821818@ NOTE Isaac II Bagratuni1
1 CONT b. circa 425, d. 483, #6385
1 CONT Pedigree 
1 CONT      Sources: 1. Toumanoff, C. 'The Orontids of Armenia' in 'Studies in Christian Caucasian History' (1963) pp.337-342. ; 2. Toumanoff, C. 'The Early Bagratids' in La Museon, (1949), pp.21-54. Isaac II Bagratuni was born circa 425
1 CONC . The placement of Isaac II as son of Tirots I seems to fit historically and chronologically but has not been proven. He was the son of Tirots I Bagratuni. Insurgent Viceroy of Armenia between 482 and 483.2 Prince of the Bagratids
1 CONC  before 483. He died in 483 in the Battle of Akesga.  
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT
